# OpenAI API Key for AI text generation and Whisper transcription
# Required for:
# - Generating Burmese recap scripts (GPT-4)
# - Creating catchy hooks (GPT-4)
# - Transcribing uploaded video files (Whisper API)
# Get your API key from: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here

# Optional: YouTube API Key for YouTube data API
# Note: Currently using youtube-transcript library which doesn't require API key
YOUTUBE_API_KEY=your_youtube_api_key_here
